OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785865789
OL,3,CTributes to 'exceptionally gifted'
OL,4,Cmakeup artist killed in North
OL,5,CYorkshire crash
OL,7,FTriutes have been paid to a BAFTA-
OL,8,Flinked makeup artist who has been
OL,9,Fkilled in a crash in North Yorkshire.
OL,11,F'Exceptionally gifted' Ava Gillies
OL,12,Fdied after the VW Polo she was driving
OL,13,Fwas involved in a collision with a
OL,14,Fblack Audi on the A170 near the
OL,15,Fvillage of Wrelton in the early hours
OL,16,Fof Wednesday morning.
OL,18,FSadly, the 26-year-old was pronounced
OL,19,Fdead at the scene.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
