FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785865789
OL,3,CTributes to 'exceptionally gifted'
OL,4,Cmakeup artist killed in North
OL,5,CYorkshire crash
OL,7,FMs Gillies was a makeup and hair
OL,8,Fartist who had worked in the TV and
OL,9,Ffilm industry.
OL,11,FAccording to her business online
OL,12,Fprofile, Ms Gillies had worked on
OL,13,Flarge scale productions including Star
OL,14,FWars, Marvel's Secret Invasion and
OL,15,FParamounts Little Disasters.
OL,17,FShe had also been a member of BAFTA
OL,18,FConnect, a scheme encouraging emerging
OL,19,Ftalent in the TV and film industry.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785865789
OL,3,CTributes to 'exceptionally gifted'
OL,4,Cmakeup artist killed in North
OL,5,CYorkshire crash
OL,7,FIn a heartfelt tribute released
OL,8,Fthrough North Yorkshire Police, Ms
OL,9,FGillies' family said: "Ava, we will
OL,10,Falways, always miss you, your wit,
OL,11,Fyour charm, your beauty, your feisty
OL,12,Fconfidence, your many talents and your
OL,13,Fexcellence in your field: hair &
OL,14,Fmakeup for film and TV.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785865789
OL,3,CTributes to 'exceptionally gifted'
OL,4,Cmakeup artist killed in North
OL,5,CYorkshire crash
OL,7,F"In almost 27 years with us, you
OL,8,Fpacked in so much, study, travel, and
OL,9,Fwork. It was a privilege to have
OL,10,Fraised you and loved you. Our
OL,11,Fbeautiful daughter, sister and
OL,12,Fgranddaughter, your loss is
OL,13,Fimmeasurable.
OL,15,F"We are so proud of your hard work and
OL,16,Fsuccess, your BAFTA Connect membership
OL,17,Fand the opportunities that brought
OL,18,Fyour career path from talented artist
OL,19,Fto new designer."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785865789
OL,3,CTributes to 'exceptionally gifted'
OL,4,Cmakeup artist killed in North
OL,5,CYorkshire crash
OL,7,FThe family added: "What's becoming
OL,8,Fclearer with every passing day is you
OL,9,Fwere loved by so many people outside
OL,10,Fthe family, your friends and the
OL,11,Fcommunity in which you were raised.
OL,13,F"We take great comfort from the
OL,14,Fcomments, cards and messages from
OL,15,Fpeople within the film industry and
OL,16,Ftheir expressions of love and respect
OL,17,Ffor your talent.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785865789
OL,3,CTributes to 'exceptionally gifted'
OL,4,Cmakeup artist killed in North
OL,5,CYorkshire crash
OL,7,F"Our family will be forever grateful
OL,8,Ffor the help, love and support we have
OL,9,Freceived from our village, family and
OL,10,Ffriends at this time.
OL,12,F"We would like to thank the emergency
OL,13,Fservices and the Police family liaison
OL,14,Fofficers. We would ask that members of
OL,15,Fthe media refrain from contacting us
OL,16,Fdirectly.
OL,18,F"Plans for Ava's funeral and a
OL,19,Fcelebration of her life will be
OL,20,Fannounced in due course."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785865789
OL,3,CTributes to 'exceptionally gifted'
OL,4,Cmakeup artist killed in North
OL,5,CYorkshire crash
OL,7,FA statement was also released by
OL,8,FLondon hair and makeup institute the
OL,9,FDelamar Academy, with who Ms Gillies
OL,10,Ftrained, describing her as
OL,11,F"exceptionally gifted".
OL,13,FThe Academy said: "Ava was an
OL,14,Fexceptionally gifted artist, and has
OL,15,Fbeen successfully building her career
OL,16,Fsince training at Delamar in 2018.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785865789
OL,3,CTributes to 'exceptionally gifted'
OL,4,Cmakeup artist killed in North
OL,5,CYorkshire crash
OL,7,FAva was a kind, creative, hardworking
OL,8,Fand lovely person who will be greatly
OL,9,Fmissed by all who knew her. Our hearts
OL,10,Fgo out to her parents and brother, and
OL,11,Fall her family and friend."
OL,13,FA police spokesperson said that no
OL,14,Farrests had occurred in relation to
OL,15,Fthe crash at this stage.
OL,17,FThe force said: "Our thoughts remain
OL,18,Fwith Ava's family, friends, and all
OL,19,Fwho knew her during this incredibly
OL,20,Fsad time."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G8/8
